00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:05,820
There was this milk tea shop close to my school that was blowing up

304
00:12:05,820 --> 00:12:07,880
I consulted a specialist

305
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:10,480
Tuesday at 8 a.m. is the best time for us to open

306
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:11,920
It'll make us a success

307
00:12:11,920 --> 00:12:12,780
Oh yeah?

308
00:12:13,340 --> 00:12:14,960
You didn't fall for another trick, did you?

309
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:17,200
Let me see the little guy

310
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:18,080
Take a break

311
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:19,500
Come here

312
00:12:19,500 --> 00:12:22,040
The same specialist picked out Dodo's name

313
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:23,440
And he's absolutely perfect

314
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:24,540
Isn't that right?

315
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:25,640
Thought so

316
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:29,480
It was so tragic

317
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:30,940
They had just opened

318
00:12:30,940 --> 00:12:32,380
Then he went missing

319
00:12:32,380 --> 00:12:38,040
Oh good, the rain stopped

320
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:50,560
I'll put up more of the missing flyers

321
00:12:50,560 --> 00:12:53,240
So why don't you stay right here and watch some more of your cartoons

322
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:54,260
Does that sound good?

323
00:12:54,260 --> 00:12:54,920
Mm-hmm

324
00:12:54,920 --> 00:13:05,540
How perfect!

325
00:13:05,940 --> 00:13:08,000
I can destroy you all at once

326
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:10,260
Now prepare to meet your doom!

327
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:15,180
Afterward, I saw him on the streets around the school a lot

328
00:13:15,180 --> 00:13:18,700
He and his wife posted countless flyers

329
00:13:18,700 --> 00:13:21,800
I can't imagine the toll

330
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:24,700
Excuse me, but would you look at this?

331
00:13:24,980 --> 00:13:26,140
Have you seen him anywhere?

332
00:13:27,580 --> 00:13:28,240
Take it

333
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:30,820
If you remember anything, please let us know at once

334
00:13:30,820 --> 00:13:32,400
I'm sorry

335
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:33,720
I've never seen your child

336
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:41,520
I wanted to tell him the truth so badly

337
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:43,780
But

338
00:13:43,780 --> 00:13:47,000
I lied instead

339
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:50,880
See, I had seen a son before

340
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:54,180
Walking with someone else

341
00:13:54,180 --> 00:13:57,060
The day he disappeared

342
00:13:57,060 --> 00:14:03,440
I've always regretted that I didn't ask any questions

343
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:06,140
Like, why is this child with you?

344
00:14:07,180 --> 00:14:09,860
I was terrified that I'd run into Mr. Liang again

345
00:14:09,860 --> 00:14:12,160
