348
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:27,780
After graduating, I avoided the area as much as I could

349
00:14:27,780 --> 00:14:31,960
I thought I could escape those hives

350
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:34,840
However

351
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:38,920
